not a demonstrated legal transfer of prior decisions. The accepted-state assignment gap is independent. Transport queues and recovery timers mean pending old work can overlap transitions; exact handler guards, not global FIFO, determine its effect.\",\n      \"behavior_ids\": [\n        \"B-formation\",\n        \"B-authority\",\n        \"B-wire\",\n        \"B-consume\"\n      ],\n      \"fact_ids\": [\n        \"F-state\",\n        \"F-prepare\"\n      ],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"S-formation\",\n        \"S-recovery\",\n        \"S-reply-wire\",\n        \"S-receive\",\n        \"S-commit\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"open_details\": [\n      \"Reachable impact of PrepareReply VBallot omission and self-reply relabeling.\",\n      \"Accept acknowledgment versus unchanged recipient Status.\",\n      \"Quorum configuration boundaries, automatic progress and optional durable restart.\",\n      \"Range-command dependency tracking and same-sequence execution ties.\"\n    ],\n    \"core_gaps\": [],\n    \"status\": \"usable\",\n    \"rationale\": \"Representative formation, per-instance authority, prior-support transfer, delivery and execution have been traced. Concrete anomalies remain questions, not assumed guarantees.\"\n  },\n  \"understanding_changes\": [\n    {\n      \"operation_id\": \"bdb765709cb347f09e6d31b65ae5f58a\",\n      \"version\": 1,\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"selections\",\n        \"match\": {\n          \"operation_id\": \"bdb765709cb347f09e6d31b65ae5f58a\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"next_objective\": {\n    \"action\": \"investigate_and_refocus\",\n    \"boundary\": \"both_core_paths\",\n    \"reason\": \"Use results to update understanding and compare the remaining frontier\",\n    \"core_gaps\": []\n  },\n  \"drafts\": [],\n  \"candidates\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"479b78003ae14c8e9e80a639cf8a0066\",\n      \"question\": {\n        \"audit_spec_version\": 1,\n        \"di